      <p>Two reasons it belongs in an investor summary and not in the plan. It is <strong>funded from operating profit</strong>, not from this round &mdash; the model already carries a SoC4 5&nbsp;nm tapeout programme as an expense line growing to &#8377;169&nbsp;Cr by FY2032. And it is the clearest statement of what the company thinks it is: not an ADAS supplier that happens to own a die, but a design team that can aim the same architecture at a different market without starting over.</p>
